{
  "manifestVersion": 2,
  "id": "the-althing",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "name": {
    "en": "The Althing",
    "zh-CN": "议事厅"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Convene expert councils in CodexHost projects and publish their findings.",
    "zh-CN": "在 CodexHost 项目中召集专家议会并发布研究结论。"
  },
  "details": {
    "en": "### Inside the council\n\n- Type `/althing <topic>` in Desktop or Web chat (just like `/goal`) to convene a council immediately — no multi-step form required.\n- Automatically assigns optimal expert seats, ready CodexHost agents, defaults, and topic-tailored roles, then plans agendas and launches the opening round automatically.\n- Customize seats, models, thinking levels, roles, or protocols anytime in the 1-screen Quick Convene dialog or **Expert roster → Configure roles & agents**.\n- Follow opening statements, peer critiques, and rebuttals in the agenda discussion, or open a delegated thread to inspect live progress.\n- Publish agenda conclusions and final reports, download standalone HTML/Markdown, or transfer councils as portable ZIP archives.",
    "zh-CN": "### 在议事厅中\n\n- 在桌面或网页聊天框输入 `/althing <主题>`（与 `/goal` 一样直接发送），无需多步向导即可一键召开议会。\n- 自动结合议题与本机已就绪的多 Agent 协作配置，智能分配专家人数、模型、推理强度与研究角色，并自动规划议程、启动首轮讨论。\n- 随时可通过单页快速配置弹窗或「专家名册 → 配置专家与角色」手动微调席位、模型、推理强度、角色与议事协议。\n- 按议程跟进独立分析、交叉质询与反驳，打开子会话查看实时进展。\n- 发布议程结论和总报告，下载独立 HTML/Markdown，或通过 ZIP 跨主机迁移完整议题。"
  },
  "author": "mythezone",
  "categories": ["workflow", "tools"],
  "settingsSchema": [
    {
      "key": "autoStartCouncil",
      "type": "boolean",
      "label": {
        "en": "Auto-dispatch opening round after AI planning",
        "zh-CN": "AI 规划议程后自动派发首轮讨论"
      },
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "key": "language",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Interface language",
        "zh-CN": "界面语言"
      },
      "default": "auto",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "auto",
          "label": {
            "en": "Follow CodexHost",
            "zh-CN": "跟随 CodexHost"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "en",
          "label": {
            "en": "English",
            "zh-CN": "英语"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "zh-CN",
          "label": {
            "en": "Simplified Chinese · 简体中文",
            "zh-CN": "简体中文"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "zh-TW",
          "label": {
            "en": "Traditional Chinese · 繁體中文",
            "zh-CN": "繁体中文"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "ja",
          "label": {
            "en": "Japanese · 日本語",
            "zh-CN": "日语 · 日本語"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "ko",
          "label": {
            "en": "Korean · 한국어",
            "zh-CN": "韩语 · 한국어"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "dataDir",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Local data directory (empty for Host default)",
        "zh-CN": "本地数据目录（留空使用宿主默认位置）"
      },
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "showProjectAlthingItems",
      "type": "boolean",
      "label": {
        "en": "Show project councils in sidebar",
        "zh-CN": "在侧栏项目下显示议会"
      },
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "key": "sidebarAlthingVisibility",
      "type": "select",
      "label": { "en": "Top-level Desktop sidebar entry", "zh-CN": "桌面侧栏顶部议事厅入口" },
      "default": "active",
      "options": [
        { "value": "active", "label": { "en": "Only during active councils", "zh-CN": "仅在有议题讨论时显示" } },
        { "value": "always", "label": { "en": "Always show", "zh-CN": "始终显示" } },
        { "value": "hidden", "label": { "en": "Always hide", "zh-CN": "始终隐藏" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "defaultProtocol",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Default protocol",
        "zh-CN": "默认议事协议"
      },
      "default": "council-standard",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "council-standard",
          "label": {
            "en": "Standard Council",
            "zh-CN": "标准议会"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "adversarial-debate",
          "label": {
            "en": "Adversarial Debate",
            "zh-CN": "对抗辩论"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "rapid-panel",
          "label": {
            "en": "Rapid Panel",
            "zh-CN": "快速评议"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "defaultTheme",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Default theme",
        "zh-CN": "默认主题"
      },
      "default": "auto",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "auto",
          "label": {
            "en": "Automatic",
            "zh-CN": "自动"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "editorial-paper",
          "label": {
            "en": "Editorial Paper",
            "zh-CN": "编辑纸页"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "cool-slate",
          "label": {
            "en": "Cool Slate",
            "zh-CN": "冷灰石板"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "obsidian-night",
          "label": {
            "en": "Obsidian Night",
            "zh-CN": "黑曜之夜"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "externalEndpoint",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Local API endpoint (empty to discover)",
        "zh-CN": "本机 API 地址（留空自动发现）"
      },
      "default": ""
